			"notes": "## [2.3.0] - 2026-11-02\n\n* Added Copper Paxels and Phaxels for Minecraft 1.7.10 and 1.21.1.\n  * Surround wooden versions with eight Copper Ingots to upgrade them.\n  * On 1.7.10, ingots must be registered as `ingotCopper` in the Ore Dictionary."
		},
