			"notes": "## [2.2.0] - 2026-11-01\n\n* Netherite Phaxels now require a Diamond Hoe instead of a Netherite Hoe.\n\n### MC 1.7.10 Changes\n\n* Added Netherite Paxels and Phaxels.\n  * Requires Netherite Ingots registered as `ingotNetherite` or `NetheriteIngot` in the Ore Dictionary.\n  * Tested with **Et Futurum Requiem** and **NetheritePlus+**.\n* Added **Et Futurum Requiem** support.\n  * Phaxels can strip logs, create paths, and till paths into farmland.\n  * Netherite upgrades work at both crafting and smithing tables."
		},
