			"notes": "## [2.1.1] - 2026-10-30\n\n* Added the Phaxel, a Paxel combined with a hoe!\n  * Right-click to use axe, shovel, and hoe actions.\n  * Paxels still have no right-click actions.\n* Crafting now preserves tool durability.\n  * Converting between Paxels and Phaxels also preserves enchantments and custom names.\n* Slightly adjusted the textures with updated shading."
		},
